WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Open the order.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.920
The terms ride on the order. Fifty down, fifty on completion.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:10.720
The Balance card shows what is left. Tap Pay.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:13.630
Type the amount. Check how they paid.

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:16.160
Then tap Submit Payment.

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:19.910
Before the invoice goes out, open it and check it.

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:27.500
Balance is zero, but it still says Deposit Required? Uncheck Show Deposit Required in Layout Options.
